HEV_HT_01. HEV_Hydraulic_Turbine: def"Bench-test hydraulic turbine for the Hydraulic Electric Vehicle concept. Upstream hydraulic pressure is developed in the plumbing and released through a controlled straight-line flow path across the outer region of the impeller. The housing directs flow and supports the rotating assembly; it is not intended to serve as the primary pressure vessel.";
purpose: (
architecture- "bench_test_component"/a;
development_stage- "prototype"/a;
pressure_source- "upstream_plumbing"/a;
housing_pressure_vessel- false/b;
);
